# Back to the Beginning (WotG 2) with the decouple module loaded and no Crystal War quest completed: the maw in
# Batallia Downs plays 501 and its finish completes the mission.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/501 RolanberryFields/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFields/onEventFinish/501 SauromugueChampaign/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger SauromugueChampaign/onEventFinish/501 BatalliaDownsS/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/701 RolanberryFieldsS/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFieldsS/onEventFinish/701 SauromugueChampaignS/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/701
module modules/custom/lua/wotg_decouple_story_missions_from_nation_quests.lua
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 501
finish
tick 400
login
